{"publicId":"8db260b4-0c67-4d87-9045-127689e8e0b9","title":"Oura收购Eli Lilly旗下远程医疗公司引利益冲突质疑","status":"watching","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-13T09:30:00.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-13T09:30:00.000Z","digest":"Oura智能手环制造商于2026年11月收购了Eli Lilly旗下远程医疗公司Counsel Health，允许后者访问Oura手环用户健康数据以辅助诊断，此举被质疑存在利益冲突。Counsel Health此前已被Eli Lilly指定为远程医疗合作伙伴，并推荐使用Oura设备。Eli Lilly称收购不会影响其与Counsel Health的合作，但内部文件显示Counsel Health曾建议Eli Lilly采用Oura设备。目前尚无证据表明数据共享已导致具体利益输送，但医学伦理专家指出需审查数据使用边界。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-13T14:13:30.673Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"Oura 收购健康科技初创公司引发 Eli Lilly 利益冲突质疑","latestReport":{"id":"qj4nmr6wl5u1hbcvi5ewnt9sw"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"f5KWqsQISmtM","title":"Oura 收购健康科技初创公司引发 Eli Lilly 利益冲突质疑","firstReportAt":"2026-11-13T09:30:00.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"qj4nmr6wl5u1hbcvi5ewnt9sw","title":"Oura 收购健康科技初创公司引发 Eli Lilly 利益冲突质疑","summary":"药企与远程医疗公司关系引发关注。Eli Lilly 旗下推荐的远程医疗公司 Counsel Health 将被智能手环制造商 Oura 收购，允许 Counsel 访问手环数据以帮助患者理解并诊断健康状况，此举引发利益冲突质疑。","source":{"name":"STAT News","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-13T09:30:00.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"qj4nmr6wl5u1hbcvi5ewnt9sw","title":"Oura 收购健康科技初创公司引发 Eli Lilly 利益冲突质疑","summary":"药企与远程医疗公司关系引发关注。Eli Lilly 旗下推荐的远程医疗公司 Counsel Health 将被智能手环制造商 Oura 收购，允许 Counsel 访问手环数据以帮助患者理解并诊断健康状况，此举引发利益冲突质疑。","source":{"name":"STAT News","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-13T09:30:00.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-13T15:00:00.000Z","heat":8.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-13T18:00:00.000Z","heat":7.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-13T20:00:00.000Z","heat":7.4,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-13T21:00:00.000Z","heat":7.2,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-13T22:00:00.000Z","heat":7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-13T23:00:00.000Z","heat":6.8,"participants":1},{"